{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Please rest assured that there is English localization in the game, but due to development time constraints, Chinese screenshots are temporarily used</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summer vacation is coming, and due to your mother's work, you and her come to a remote town together to establish a communication base station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The name of the town is Wenquan Town, but due to its remote location and lack of internet access, there are not many people in the town anymore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this simple town, you will meet all kinds of people and experience different stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to obtain funds through activities such as insect catching, fishing, flower picking, bird watching, while enjoying rural life. Use the funds to purchase small town stalls, attract customers, rebuild convenience stores and other shops, and hire staff; After the establishment of the internet, using social media to take beautiful pictures to attract migrant workers; Maintain town roads, road management, etc Start the plan to revitalize the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/\u5f00\u573a.png?t=1741307527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use WASD to move and space to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/1.png?t=1741307527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make good use of tools to fish, catch insects, and farm freely in the small town, and earn income to buy fun things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/2.png?t=1741307527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/3.png?t=1741307527\" />Check your catalog, there are captured collectibles inside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/4.png?t=1741307527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone loves fishing and farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/5.png?t=1741307527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roaming by car in the small town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/6.png?t=1741307527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have internet, you can upload a beauty map to social media, get a comment and attention to the good news, make more exotic population travel to the town, and it is likely to get more town income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/7.png?t=1741307527\" />If you feel tired, you can also spend time at home and improve your character's attributes by resting and relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/8.png?t=1741307527\" />Additionally, based on the collected collectibles, if it is of green quality or higher, unexpected buffs can be obtained!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/9.png?t=1741307527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is under continuous development....</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573190?t=1741307527","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573190?t=1741307527","capsule_image":"https://shared